\b0 \
Hearing this, the exiles face a decision. They can continue to see their situation through available frameworks: Babylonian power, commercial calculation, political realism. These frameworks suggest YHWH was local deity defeated by larger forces, that survival requires accommodation to how things work, that covenant language was always provincial mythology.\
