\b Our situation
\b0 \
We are not exiles in Babylon. But we are surrounded by frameworks that function as Tyre's framework functioned.\
The commercial framework: everything is transaction, value is price, human attention and behavior are commodities to optimize. This framework literally cannot perceive holiness, covenant, or divine sovereignty \'97 not because it denies them but because it has no categories for them. A trade network sees 
