The political-realist framework: power determines outcomes, survival requires accommodation to power, moral categories are provincial mythology that sophisticated observers have outgrown. This is Moab's conclusion dressed in contemporary clothing.\
These frameworks are praised. They are mighty in their domains. They impose their 
