\b The recognition available to us
\b0 \
Like the exiles, we hear this before the waves arrive. The judgment on Tyre was spoken before Nebuchadnezzar's siege, before Alexander's causeway. The text treats future destruction as present reality because divine speech accomplishes what it declares.\
We can adopt the knowledge that the nations will receive through 
